        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Lendley C. Black\n- Organizations: University of Minnesota Duluth\n- Roles: Chancellor\n- Topics: Academic programs\n\nFacts:\n- Dr. Lendley C. \"Lynn\" Black began serving as Chancellor of the University of Minnesota Duluth on August 1, 2010.\n- The University of Minnesota Duluth is Duluth's regional comprehensive university.\n- The University of Minnesota Duluth offers 14 bachelor's degrees across 85 majors.\n- The University of Minnesota Duluth offers graduate programs in 27 different fields.\n- The University of Minnesota Duluth includes a two-year program at the School of Medicine, a four-year College of Pharmacy program, and a Doctor of Education program.",
